{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/unKjsQBiYDHaJGxpVjUsUw?click_id=110","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:05.461919+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/unKjsQBiYDHaJGxpVjUsUw?click_id=110","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zr0xm3WCEQicCu2weLRPy5BlUdEiaqYh0bib8lPtGsmm0p6Jco26IviczzVFxpbn0vdhia7q4xC0DbWUecRjTNDd3tQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><strong><span>一、申请对象</span></strong></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>1.拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化国家建设服务，品行端正，遵纪守法。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.已获得或预计能获得所在高校2025年推荐免试攻读硕士研究生资格的全国大学优秀应届本科毕业生。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.在校期间学习成绩优秀，学术研究兴趣浓厚，具备较强的创新意识、专业能力、创新能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.申请人员具有突出的科研能力与潜质，原则上具有良好的英语应用能力与较好的数学、经济学基础。</span></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>1.本科阶段成绩单1份（需加盖所在学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.国家英语四级或六级考试合格证书1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请人的获奖证书、体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文、出版物或原创性工作效果等材料1份；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.参加过院系“夏令营”、“暑期学校”、“开放日”等活动的证明材料1份。</span></span></p><p><span><span>请将上述证明材料制成PDF格式后，压缩成一个压缩文件（zip）格式文件并注明</span></span><strong><span><span>“姓名-学校-申请专业-联系电话”</span></span></strong><span><span>后发到指定邮箱。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zr0xm3WCEQicCu2weLRPy5BlUdEiaqYh0bFdfgcq1BEpicdJZgx3QWVmnFjWpIz12OUdUqsuibicdskeslqon6bYvdA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、申请办法</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>1.提交申请材料</span></span></p><p><span><span>有意者请于2025年9月21日前将上述要求的电子材料提交到专用邮箱：</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：0791-83816310、0791-83820732</span></span></p><p><span><span>材料接受邮箱：jcyjyjs@163.com</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.资格初审</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院研究生招生领导小组对申请进行初审，确认是否接收申请，并请申请者提供准确联系信息，届时，学院将通知初审合格的申请者来我校参加复试。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.复试：复试一般为面试与笔试相结合（具体形式根据学校后续统一要求确定）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.考生身体状况应符合国家规定的体检标准(同普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见)。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.接收推免生的硕士点为：产业经济学、国土资源与生态经济学、数字经济硕士。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.接收的推免生专业为</span></span><strong><span><span>经济学类、管理学类、数学类、计算机类、统计学类、地理学类等</span></span></strong><span><span>（接收人数以学校实际下达指标数为准）。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/zr0xm3WCEQicCu2weLRPy5BlUdEiaqYh0byLeAOLDDL0u1ibwflhRgcNQ7KlwR3EGHIbfMP3ByrkHtWa7BC5qAVJA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、奖学金体系</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>全日制硕士研究生奖助体系包括学业奖学金、国家助学金、国家奖学金、江西省政府奖学金、优秀奖学金、单项奖学金、“三助”岗位津贴等多项奖助学金。</span></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>1.预报名阶段，接受时间</span></span><strong><span><span>从即日起至9月21日</span></span></strong><span><span>止，请有意者尽早报名；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.请申请者务必提供自身准确有效的联系方式、联系邮箱，以免错失机会；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.申请人必须保证提交的全部申请材料的真实性和准确性，我院将对拟录取的推荐免试研究生张榜公示，如果申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，我校将取消其录取资格或取消其学籍。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>数字经济学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年9月9日</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><span>编辑|陈姝冰</span></span></p><p><span><span>责任编辑|陈姝冰 李京力</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核|孔繁恺 曾爱英 习明明</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/zr0xm3WCEQicPSiccsSoEwMVibEGZbglib9md8qDcULbEXMJR7hqDrRbPV5uguo2nengnMjUyEz35d52CFpicmaOnNg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg#imgIndex=8\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b689b909f09ce4ca7144dd0116c8c0165ef211b9735786792be8628f3fe0e8d9","textLength":1044,"sourceSha256":"8386425bcdffbdd08ae048b044b0a4071bf77a3fbf14ba8e10ed4e8e4262dd61","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2768f4ebde90ed8ea67e","title":"2025年江西财经大学数字经济学院关于接收2026年研究生推免生预报名的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:02:05.461919+00:00"}
